WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.166
95% of people building AI applications right now are doing something fatally flawed.

2
00:00:04.366 --> 00:00:08.333
They obsess over prompt wrappers without building any proprietary workflow state memory.

3
00:00:08.533 --> 00:00:12.500
When the foundation model updates, their entire application is commoditized overnight.